Spears are the way to go until you get an artifact and still
work nicely as ranged weapons. They stack so you can enchant
several at once and you can reach skilled with them. The one
priest I ascended traded in his mace on the first spear he
found, advanced to skilled and later used the spears as his
ranged attack. Seems that was a chaotic priest who finished
using Stormbringer as his wielded weapon.

I think he was a pretty good spellcaster as well. My usual
approach, with any but a wizard, is to play without spells
until I find some dragon scales and then convert to spell
friendly armor.

